@DSP1610-ST Release Notes
Release 3.4.2


Release Notes
March 1994





                              DSP1610-ST Release 3.4.2


Introduction

The following information reviews the new features and bug fixes for the 3.4.2
release of the Support Software Tools for the DSP1610 Digital Signal Processor.
This document covers only the chip-specific tools and not the Software
Generation System (SGS), the DSP1610 device, or other hardware tools.



